exports[`git.branch.rebase.continue given: [case7] rebase in progress with unstaged modifications (no unmerged files) when: [t0] attempt continue with unstaged modifications then: shows error: unstaged changes block continue 1`] = `
"🐢 hold up dude...

🐚 git.branch.rebase continue
   └─ ✋ ConstraintError: unstaged changes found at paths not set aside
      └─ README.md

🥥 did you know?
   ├─ stage them if they are resolution work; or set them aside too, put back after (a set-aside edit stays out of the commit)
   ├─ rhx git.stage.add README.md
   └─ rhx git.branch.rebase continue --unstaged ignore
"
`;
